WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.760 --> 00:00:08.430
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie and in case you
missed it Bryke induced a Korra related Fandom

00:00:08.430 --> 00:00:09.930
Heart Attack yesterday.

00:00:09.930 --> 00:00:13.030
The revealed that Book 4 would premiere October
3rd.

00:00:13.030 --> 00:00:17.090
So I’ll explain what’s happening, when
episodes are posting and how my videos for

00:00:17.090 --> 00:00:18.090
it will work.

00:00:18.090 --> 00:00:21.630
I think it’s one of the best things Nickelodeon
could have done given all the craziness this

00:00:21.630 --> 00:00:22.630
year.

00:00:22.630 --> 00:00:29.720
So first things first, Episode 1 of Book 4
will post October 3rd to all the digital platforms

00:00:29.720 --> 00:00:32.820
Book 3 was on.

00:00:32.820 --> 00:00:47.820
Book 4 is titled Balance, but the only episode
title we know right now is for the very final

00:00:47.820 --> 00:00:48.820
episode.

00:00:48.820 --> 00:00:52.309
In case you don’t want to know what that
is just turn the volume down until this spoiler

00:00:52.309 --> 00:00:53.960
tag goes away.

00:00:53.960 --> 00:00:57.109
I’ll wait just a sec….okay.

00:00:57.109 --> 00:01:03.350
The very last episode of Korra ever is called
“Avatar Korra”.

00:01:03.350 --> 00:01:04.350
Okay spoiler over.

00:01:04.350 --> 00:01:09.390
Right now we don’t know if they’re going
to do a double episode premiere like Book

00:01:09.390 --> 00:01:12.410
3 or if they’ll just air episodes one week
at a time.

00:01:12.410 --> 00:01:14.610
I’d plan on a double episode premiere.

00:01:14.610 --> 00:01:18.310
That’s been the way they’ve done if for
a while.

00:01:18.310 --> 00:01:22.130
I’ll post updates as we learn more about
the exact airdates for everything.

00:01:22.130 --> 00:01:29.370
A lot of you have asked about the videos I’ll
do for it since Constantine on NBC is my new

00:01:29.370 --> 00:01:30.370
Friday Show.

00:01:30.370 --> 00:01:32.740
The good news is Korra videos post at about
9AM in my timezone and Constantine episodes

00:01:32.740 --> 00:01:36.370
don’t air on tv till 10PM.

00:01:36.370 --> 00:01:38.170
So I’ll totally have time to post my Korra
videos early in the day.

00:01:38.170 --> 00:01:39.170
See everything works out.

00:01:39.170 --> 00:01:40.680
I don’t have to have another heart attack.

00:01:40.680 --> 00:01:44.840
I’ll just be doing the normal types of Korra
videos I’ve always done.

00:01:44.840 --> 00:01:46.200
And the Korra giveaway will start up again.

00:01:46.200 --> 00:01:48.310
So if you’re finding me for the first time.

00:01:48.310 --> 00:01:50.659
Be sure to subscribe to get all that stuff.

00:01:50.659 --> 00:01:55.210
I also live tweet sometimes, so links for
social in the description.

00:01:55.210 --> 00:01:58.409
Yes it does suck a little when you remember
this is the beginning of the end.

00:01:58.409 --> 00:02:02.340
But what will probably happen is as we near
the end of Book 4, I’ll just let everyone

00:02:02.340 --> 00:02:03.340
vote on a new anime series we can watch together.

00:02:03.340 --> 00:02:04.790
Silver lining in things going away is that
it allows you time to find something new to

00:02:04.790 --> 00:02:05.790
fall in love with.

00:02:05.790 --> 00:02:06.790
So don’t cry yet.

00:02:06.790 --> 00:02:07.790
Save that for the premiere.

00:02:07.790 --> 00:02:11.909
As of right now we don’t have a lot of information
about the story of book 4.

00:02:11.909 --> 00:02:16.350
There was that Kuvira teaser but so far all
we know is she might be one of the antagonists.

00:02:16.350 --> 00:02:19.920
The idea that the whole book is about Balance
implies that Korra will be brokering some

00:02:19.920 --> 00:02:22.230
sort of arrangement between the spirit world
and the physical world, and a new arragement

00:02:22.230 --> 00:02:23.609
between the political forces in the world.

00:02:23.609 --> 00:02:27.170
As of the end of book 3, the spirits are still
popping up everywhere taking over certain

00:02:27.170 --> 00:02:31.180
parts of the cities and the governments are
being thrown into chaos.

00:02:31.180 --> 00:02:34.709
I know we were mostly localized to the earth
kingdom in book 3, but I felt like it was

00:02:34.709 --> 00:02:39.090
implied that Zaheer’s chaos would spread
to the surrounding area eventually.

00:02:39.090 --> 00:02:42.290
The other big question is who’s coming back.

00:02:42.290 --> 00:02:49.310
I know we all want to see the rest of the
surviving last airbender characters come back,

00:02:49.310 --> 00:02:53.629
but the only confirmation I’ve found is
from Daniel Dae Kim, the actor who plays Asami’s

00:02:53.629 --> 00:02:54.629
father.

00:02:54.629 --> 00:02:55.629
Hiroshi Sato.

00:02:55.629 --> 00:02:58.519
He said he was coming back last year, and
since we didn’t see him in book 3, that

00:02:58.519 --> 00:02:59.519
means book 4.

00:02:59.519 --> 00:03:01.680
The same thing happened with Grey Delisle.

00:03:01.680 --> 00:03:07.419
She was confirmed coming back before Book
2, but it turned out that meant she was coming

00:03:07.419 --> 00:03:08.790
back in book 3.

00:03:08.790 --> 00:03:16.889
Stuff like that mostly happens because the
voice over work is done way before the animation

00:03:16.889 --> 00:03:17.889
is ever finished.

00:03:17.889 --> 00:03:22.639
So for example, they were doing Book 4 voice
over work while Book 2 was finishing it’s

00:03:22.639 --> 00:03:23.639
run on tv.

00:03:23.639 --> 00:03:25.540
That’s how far ahead they are.

00:03:25.540 --> 00:03:32.219
Right now they are going to New York Comic
Con.

00:03:32.219 --> 00:03:36.159
That’s happening October 9th to the 12th.

00:03:36.159 --> 00:03:39.700
So they might also do an early screening of
a future episode.

00:03:39.700 --> 00:03:42.890
Or air some clips from later in book 4.

00:03:42.890 --> 00:03:53.719
Now that the season is starting, if you do
have a chance to go to the panel.

00:03:53.719 --> 00:03:55.730
I won’t be there.

00:03:55.730 --> 00:04:03.620
I would recommend you focus any questions
you ask them on whether or not they’ll be

00:04:03.620 --> 00:04:06.489
doing any korra comics or other expanded material.

00:04:06.489 --> 00:04:08.069
Future video games, etcetera.

00:04:08.069 --> 00:04:11.650
If they’ll be continuing the story in some
other format.

00:04:11.650 --> 00:04:21.610
They’ve already finished the finale and
they’ve already said they’re not doing

00:04:21.610 --> 00:04:23.980
more Avatar shows.

00:04:23.980 --> 00:04:50.940
So asking them if there’s going to be a
new avatar show is a big waste of a question.

00:04:50.940 --> 00:04:55.100
The real question is do they know if Nickelodeon
will continue the comics.

00:04:55.100 --> 00:04:59.330
Depending on the success of the Korra video
game, they’ll probably make sequels to that.

00:04:59.330 --> 00:05:00.760
But there’s no guarantee.

00:05:00.760 --> 00:05:05.040
Also, I’m really hoping someone asks them
what they’re next project is.

00:05:05.040 --> 00:05:25.650
Or if they aren’t ready to 

00:05:25.650 --> 00:05:57.960
announce it, what’s the date when they 
do expect to announce something.

00:05:57.960 --> 00:06:04.840
The worst part in any fandom, is the waiting.

00:06:04.840 --> 00:06:54.380
Just waiting for the second part of a two
part story, waiting for 

00:06:54.380 --> 00:07:06.910
the 
next season and waiting to find out what’s

00:07:06.910 --> 00:07:07.950
coming next.

00:07:07.950 --> 00:07:36.320
Waiting in lines at Comic Con 

00:07:36.320 --> 00:07:47.430
is also a huge bummer.

00:07:47.430 --> 00:07:52.730
Like I said though, no matter what, everyone
will get a chance to vote on which new anime

00:07:52.730 --> 00:07:54.470
series I do videos for.

00:07:54.470 --> 00:08:13.900
Don’t worry about it right now, but be thinking
of suggestions and feel free to write them

00:08:13.900 --> 00:08:14.900
in the comments.

00:08:14.900 --> 00:08:18.010
Generally I just ask that it be something
everyone around the world can gain access

00:08:18.010 --> 00:08:22.190
too for super cheap.

00:08:22.190 --> 00:08:30.380
It won’t work if it’s super expensive
or you can’t stream it.

00:08:30.380 --> 00:08:37.800
Since the Korra Premiere is in about 3 weeks
I’ll just keep doing weekly bonus videos.

00:08:37.800 --> 00:08:40.510
I’m slowly getting into my fall schedule
of videos.

00:08:40.510 --> 00:08:44.510
So I’ll have a link here where you can learn
more about that.

00:08:44.510 --> 00:08:49.690
This video was made before Book 4 was announced,
so just mentally add Korra Fridays to the

00:08:49.690 --> 00:08:50.690
list.

00:08:50.690 --> 00:08:51.960
And click here for my Book 4 Predictions.

00:08:51.960 --> 00:08:55.640
Thanks for watching, see you guys tomorrow.

00:08:55.640 --> 00:08:57.440
High Fives!

